      "date": "2026-05-11T13:22:00.000Z",
      "title": "Sarla Performance Fibers Limited (BSE:526885) announces an Equity Buyback for 4,000,000 shares, representing 4.79% for INR 440 million.",
      "body": "Sarla Performance Fibers Limited (BSE:526885) announces a share repurchase program. Under the program, the company will repurchase up to 4,000,000 shares, representing 4.79% of the total number of equity shares for INR 440 million. The shares will be repurchased at a price of INR 110 per share. The company has fixed May 15, 2026 as the record date for program. The buyback will be sourced out of its securities premium account, free reserves and/ or current surplus and/or cash and cash equivalents or internal accruals and liquid resource. The purpose of the program is to improve earning per share and other key ratios such as return on net worth  and return on assets over a period of time. As of May 11, 2026, the company has 83,503,000 shares in issue.",
